.TH ZOVELIS-INSTALL 1 "October 2026" "Zovelis OS 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zovelis-install \- start the Zovelis OS installer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zovelis-install
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zovelis-install
starts the graphical installer (Calamares) with administrator rights, from
the Zovelis OS live system. On the live system no password is needed; the
installer refuses to run anywhere else.
.PP
The installer copies the live system to the chosen disk, creates the user
account, sets up the GRUB boot loader (with Secure Boot support on UEFI) and
removes the live-system tools and itself from the installed system. Its log
is kept in
.IR /var/log/installer/calamares.log .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR calamares (8)
